    "15": {
      "note": "task_doc authoring no longer exposes successful get/read_steps projections or step_payloads. The early operation-removed answer guides canonical JSON/rendered-file reading. Ordinary writes deliver bounded phrases, create retains renderedPath, changed reviewState stays visible, and dry answers carry wouldLose/diff with independently retained locations; rich identity/preview/masterSync remains whole-result custody and a validly addressed parent sync failure is an answered refusal. Invalid caller master references instead raise TaskDocError through the shared resolver before publication, after the retained retirement-row comparison. Linkage reporting writes its facts JSON and delivers counts/location; attach/detach retain per-document previews internally. Shared task_doc_phrases owns the actual mutable allowlist, excluding seriesContractPath/enclosures. Publication refreshes the own leaf plus declared requirement copies with rollback, without turning copies into task authority. Strict model facts come from models/task_doc.py; no historical pending-model statement certifies a live session.",
